  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-07-12T18:26:26.881Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The ability to have events trigger at a certain time or on a certain interval.\n\nFor example:\n\n-a gate that would only open between the hours of 6-8 GMT\n\n-a sun that could reflect the real world time (biased on either individual players time zones or a specific time zone) \n\n-an event that would trigger every 10 minutes or so\n\nEdit:  \n-Even better: an event that triggers after a delay.  This could substitute the time interval event, as an event could just call itself on a delay, as well as providing a whole host of other uses.  ",
